    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+, Lords' Alliance Agent Feat)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Strength or Charisma score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Standard Bearer.</strong> As a Bonus Action, choose up to three creatures within 60 feet of you that can see you. Each can immediately take a Reaction to stand up and end the Prone condition, provided its Speed isn't 0.</p><p>You also bolster their resolve for 1 minute, or until you have the Incapacitated condition. While bolstered, a target can't be possessed or gain the Charmed or Frightened condition; if it is already possessed, Charmed, or Frightened, it has Advantage on any new saving throw against that effect. Once you use this benefit, you can't do so again until you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
